        "title": "Write in terms of sine and cosine",
        "text": "$$\\frac{\\tan(3x)-\\tan(x)}{1+\\tan(3x)\\tan(x)}=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{\\cos(3x)}-\\frac{\\sin(x)}{\\cos(x)}}{1+\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6cf981T222-identanglesum-P03a-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6cf981T222-identanglesum-P03a-h1"
        ],
        "title": "Find common denominators in numerator and denominator",
        "text": "$$\\frac{\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{\\cos(3x)}-\\frac{\\sin(x)}{\\cos(x)}}{1+\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\cos(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}-\\frac{\\sin(x)\\cos(3x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}{\\frac{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}+\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a6cf981T222-identanglesum-P03a-h3",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a6cf981T222-identanglesum-P03a-h2"
        ],
        "title": "Simplify",
        "text": "$$\\frac{\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\cos(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}-\\frac{\\sin(x)\\cos(3x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}{\\frac{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}+\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}=\\frac{\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\cos(x)-\\cos(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}{\\frac{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)+\\sin(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)}}$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
