        "text": "$$\\frac{\\sin(3x)\\cos(x)-\\cos(3x)\\sin(x)}{\\cos(3x)\\cos(x)+\\sin(3x)\\sin(x)}=\\frac{\\sin(2x)}{\\cos(2x)}=\\tan(2x)$$",
